WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:04.310
A new and glorious dawn breaks over the Middle
East,

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:06.120
where rigorous American bombing campaigns

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:09.440
have blasted the region into a friendly golf
course of democracy.

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:13.620
It's all part of America's comprehensive,
methodically planned foreign policy strategy.

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:16.200
Let's look back at our nation’s glorious
adventures in:

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:17.420
Intervention!

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:19.300
A Success Story!

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:21.760
1953.

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:24.860
The United States topples the democratically-elected
government of Iran

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:27.740
and installs a king favorable to our oil interests.

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:32.280
The shah likes America, ensuring that our
nations will be friends forever!

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:37.540
In 1979 Iran ousts the Shah which America
helpfully installed,

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:41.320
and is inexplicably distrustful of the United
States meddling in its affairs.

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:42.339
But don’t worry!

00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:44.260
When Iraq and Iran go to war a year later,

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:47.840
President Reagan provides aid to America’s
good friend Saddam Hussein.

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:51.260
Thus ensuring peaceful relations with Iraq
forever!

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:55.020
During the Cold War, Islamist fighters in
Afghanistan

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:57.500
square off against the godless Soviets.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:01.160
America aids a group of staunch anti-Russians
called the Mujahadeen,

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:04.180
including an energetic young man named Osama
bin Laden.

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:09.180
Thus ensuring a beneficial relationship between
the United States and Afghanistan forever!

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:15.040
In 1991 America goes to war with Iraq’s
evil dictator Saddam Hussein,

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:16.700
who had illegally occupied Kuwait.

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:20.260
After a brief period of vigorous bombing,
President Bush declares victory.

00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:24.120
Thus ensuring that America need never return
to Iraq, forever!

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:28.180
In 2001, the United States declares war on
the Taliban

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:31.560
for shielding evil terrorist mastermind Osama
bin Laden.

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:35.760
We may never know how Afghanistan’s ultra-conservative jihadist government came to power,

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:37.490
or from where they got their guns.

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:42.180
But we do know that America’s ongoing presence
ensures a lasting peace with a grateful people.

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:42.980
Forever!

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:49.700
In 2003 President George W. Bush ousts evil
strongman dictator Saddam Hussein.

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:53.000
Thus ensuring a democratic, prosperous Iraq
forever!

00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:58.800
In 2011 President Barack Obama topples the
government of evil Libyan dictator

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:00.020
Muammar Gaddafi.

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:02.780
Thus ensuring a peaceful Libya forever!

00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:05.740
Especially in Benghazi, forever!

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:09.740
In 2016 Nobel Peace Prize winner President
Obama

00:02:09.740 --> 00:02:12.780
drops over 26,000 bombs across seven different
nations.

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:15.640
Thus ensuring blah blah blah forever!

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:20.820
In 2017 Bashar al Assad unleashes chemical
weapons in Syria,

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:23.820
provoking the wrath of new US President Donald
Trump.

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:29.320
Trump fires a symbolic fuselage of missiles
at Syria, thus solving the Assad problem forever!

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:33.480
A year later Bashar al Assad unleashes chemical
weapons again in Syria

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:36.320
after apparently failing to notice the previous
bombing.

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:40.180
The direct threat to American national defense
which Syria poses is self-evident,

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:43.000
and President Trump authorizes a new strike
against the regime

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:46.120
thus ensuring American safety forever!

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:51.040
Today scientists believe the Middle East is
one strategic bombing away from a lasting peace.

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:53.260
President Trump’s fiery sucker punch in
Syria

00:02:53.260 --> 00:02:56.360
could be that penultimate explosion the region
so clearly needs.

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:59.760
Freeing the United States to turn her attention
to other trouble spots around the globe,

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:03.300
and there to enforce an aggressive peace,
forever!

